---
---

<section class="support-inner">
  <h2>
    <span class="lang-en">Sponsor my work</span>
    <span class="lang-vi">Ủng hộ tôi</span>
  </h2>
  <p class="intro">
    <span class="lang-en">If something I built has helped you, a small contribution keeps things going. Or buy a course or tool you need through my links — it helps just as much.</span>
    <span class="lang-vi">Nếu thứ tôi tạo ra giúp ích cho bạn, một đóng góp nhỏ sẽ giúp mọi thứ tiếp tục. Hoặc mua khóa học hay sản phẩm bạn cần từ link của tôi — cũng giúp ích không kém.</span>
  </p>

  <div class="channel-row">
    <article class="channel">
      <div class="channel-head">
        <h3>GitHub Sponsors</h3>
        <span class="audience">Intl</span>
      </div>
      <p>
        <span class="lang-en">One-time / monthly via Open Source Collective.</span>
        <span class="lang-vi">Một lần hoặc hàng tháng qua Open Source Collective.</span>
      </p>
      <a class="cta" href="https://github.com/sponsors/hueanmy">
        <span class="lang-en">Sponsor &rarr;</span>
        <span class="lang-vi">Ủng hộ &rarr;</span>
      </a>
    </article>

    <article class="channel">
      <div class="channel-head">
        <h3>MoMo</h3>
        <span class="audience">VN</span>
      </div>
      <p>
        <span class="lang-en">Scan QR with MoMo app, no fee.</span>
        <span class="lang-vi">Quét QR bằng app MoMo, không phí.</span>
      </p>
      <details class="qr-reveal">
        <summary>QR &darr;</summary>
        <img src="/momo-qr.jpg" alt="MoMo QR code" class="qr" />
      </details>
    </article>

    <article class="channel">
      <div class="channel-head">
        <h3>VietQR</h3>
        <span class="audience">VN</span>
      </div>
      <p>
        <span class="lang-en">Bank transfer via any VietQR-supported app.</span>
        <span class="lang-vi">Chuyển khoản qua app ngân hàng hỗ trợ VietQR.</span>
      </p>
      <details class="qr-reveal">
        <summary>QR &darr;</summary>
        <img src="/vietqr.jpg" alt="VietQR code" class="qr" />
      </details>
    </article>
  </div>

  <p class="thanks">
    <span class="lang-en">Thank you &mdash; it really means a lot.</span>
    <span class="lang-vi">Cảm ơn bạn rất nhiều.</span>
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .intro {
    color: var(--fg-dim);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    max-width: 34rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .channel-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .channel {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 0.85rem;
    transition: border-color 150ms ease;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .channel:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }

  .channel-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .channel h3 { font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--fg); }

  .audience {
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--accent);
    padding: 0.08rem 0.4rem;
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    border-radius: 3px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .channel p {
    color: var(--fg-dim);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .cta,
  .qr-reveal summary {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.7rem;
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 5px;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: background 150ms ease;
    align-self: flex-start;
  }

  .qr-reveal summary { cursor: pointer; list-style: none; user-select: none; }
  .cta:hover, .qr-reveal summary:hover { background: var(--accent-soft); color: var(--accent-hover); }
  .qr-reveal summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }

  .qr {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 180px;
    height: auto;
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: #fff;
    padding: 6px;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .thanks {
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    font-style: italic;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .channel-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .channel-head { align-items: baseline; }
  }
</style>